@startuml sequence-layanan-service
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #dae8fc
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #6c8ebf

actor Customer
participant "Browser" as B
participant "Next.js Page\n/faq" as P
participant "API Route\n/api/faqs" as A
participant "Prisma ORM" as PR
database "MySQL DB" as DB

Customer -> B: Buka halaman FAQ
B -> P: GET /faq
P -> A: fetch(/api/faqs)
A -> PR: faq.findMany()
PR -> DB: SELECT * FROM FAQ
DB --> PR: data FAQ
PR --> A: List<FAQ>
A --> P: JSON response
P --> B: Render halaman FAQ
B --> Customer: Tampilkan daftar pertanyaan

Customer -> B: Klik salah satu pertanyaan
B --> Customer: Tampilkan jawaban (accordion)

@enduml